WEBVTT

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:00.840
I'm Sathian,

00:00:01.125 --> 00:00:03.190
founder of Tooth Fairy Network and

00:00:03.190 --> 00:00:04.090
a father of two.

00:00:04.462 --> 00:00:05.942
I built this for my own

00:00:05.942 --> 00:00:06.322
children.

00:00:07.445 --> 00:00:09.225
And I'm making it available to

00:00:09.225 --> 00:00:10.685
the rest of the world for

00:00:10.685 --> 00:00:12.265
anyone who wants to learn along

00:00:12.265 --> 00:00:12.885
with us.

00:00:13.717 --> 00:00:15.537
Welcome to Learn with Tanda.

00:00:16.217 --> 00:00:16.367
Together,

00:00:16.557 --> 00:00:18.497
we'll explore how the technology works

00:00:18.497 --> 00:00:19.797
through simple stories,

00:00:20.197 --> 00:00:20.557
questions,

00:00:21.117 --> 00:00:22.037
and drawing activities.

00:00:22.458 --> 00:00:23.937
Pick a lesson with your child,

00:00:24.477 --> 00:00:26.437
and let's discover something together.
